<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Blazor-Wasm on Alfero Chingono</title><link>https://www.chingono.com/tags/blazor-wasm/</link><description>Recent content in Blazor-Wasm on Alfero Chingono</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 25 Mar 2022 22:59:55 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://www.chingono.com/tags/blazor-wasm/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Dockerizing Blazor Wasm Application</title><link>https://www.chingono.com/blog/2021/04/07/dockerizing-blazor-wasm-application/</link><pubDate>Wed, 07 Apr 2021 18:39:49 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.chingono.com/blog/2021/04/07/dockerizing-blazor-wasm-application/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://www.chingono.com/blog/2021/04/07/dockerizing-blazor-wasm-application/cover.jpg" alt="Featured image of post Dockerizing Blazor Wasm Application" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a continuation of my previous post; &lt;a class="link" href="https://www.chingono.com/blog/2021/03/04/waiting-docker-service-container-port-ready/" &gt;Waiting for Docker Service Container Port to Be Ready&lt;/a&gt;. After reading &lt;a class="link" href="https://www.c-sharpcorner.com/article/dockerizing-blazor-wasm-application/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt;this article&lt;/a&gt;, I decided to build up on that codebase as a learning opportunity and add a Blazor WASM front-end to the .NET Core API already built.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I will not repeat the process details as that is nicely outlined in the referenced article. What I will do here is share my version of the &lt;code&gt;Dockerfile&lt;/code&gt; and the associated script and configuration file.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So, here&amp;rsquo;s my &lt;code&gt;Dockerfile&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 9
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;10
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;11
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;12
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;13
